  "description": "Nestled in a  picturesque countryside setting, this charming four-bedroom cottage enjoys an enviable position located beside the renowned Kilkea Castle Golf Club. Set close to a  historic 12th-century castle and rolling parkland, where the landscape is shaped by mature trees, gentle undulations, and the meandering River Griese that weaves through the course .\nThe home itself combines comfort and character, making it ideal for family living. With four bedrooms, it provides ample space for both relaxation and entertaining, while its tranquil surroundings create a true sense of escape from the bustle of everyday life.\nConvenience is equally to the fore, with a well-regarded primary school located nearby, making it an excellent choice for families. The property also benefits from easy access to the M9 motorway, ensuring swift connections to Dublin, Carlow, Kilkenny, and beyond perfect for commuters seeking a peaceful rural base without sacrificing accessibility.\nThis is a rare opportunity to enjoy country living in a truly scenic location, with world-class golfing on your doorstep and essential amenities just minutes away.Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\nPhotographs and floor plan  will give you an idea of the features and layout of the property but there is nothing like a physical in person viewing.",
